{"id": "69545", "title": "花信可期", "author": "妙颂九方01", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 22, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69545.htm", "intro": "这才是人生难预料，\r\n 不想团圆在今朝。\r\n 回首繁华如梦渺，\r\n 残生一线付惊涛。\r\n 莫在痴嗔休啼笑，\r\n 教导器儿多勤劳。\r\n 今日相逢得此报，\r\n 愧我当初赠木桃。\r\n 龙生九子个不同。师父是西北草原狼，收的徒弟却是满世界招蜂引蝶的狐狸。一没留神就被小狐狸摄去了元神，从此之后的日子才是色彩缤纷。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69545", "chapters": [{"title": "1——", "file": "10646900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2——", "file": "10646901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3——", "file": "10646902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4——", "file": "10646903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5——", "file": "10646904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6——", "file": "10646905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7——", "file": "10646906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8——", "file": "10646907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9——", "file": "10646908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10——", "file": "10646909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11——", "file": "10646910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12——", "file": "10646911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13——", "file": "10646912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14——", "file": "10646913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15——", "file": "10646914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16——", "file": "10646915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17——", "file": "10646916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18——", "file": "10646917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19——", "file": "10646918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20——", "file": "10646919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21——", "file": "10646920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22——", "file": "10646921.html", "available": false}]}